  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2025 Feedback"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Impressions"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "# Matthew’s Thoughts"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Alright, so for the website, I'd like to start working on a couple things. One, I'll be creating a new copy document for you to copy/paste when you're ready. I will try to have this completed by the time we're meeting on Thursday next week. Two, I would like to see the following pages also added to the site. Can you please look into a possible format for the requisite pages?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **\"Services\" page**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- quick breakdown of the services we offer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- a menu of sorts that breaks it down"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- a form to put in a formal inquiry)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **\"Storytelling\" page**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- A \"We tell stories and build products that promote storytelling\" type of page."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Featured contents:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Gumbo Magazine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Docket TV"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Reckoning With Race"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- [Blackwords.co](http://blackwords.co/)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Etc."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "If there's a better way to frame that Storytelling page that makes more sense, let's discuss. maybe it's two different pages, or a page by a different name. We could do \"Stories,\" \"Products,\" and \"Services\" or something. Lemme know."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "# Austin’s Thoughts"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Here’s some initial thoughts! There's likely some context that I'm missing for some of these things, so disregard if we're on the same page."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- I think we should consider shifting some of the bolded language below from the first page. While I do believe this is true, as the first bit of language on the site, I feel we should consider something that aligns with the building brands for impact copy that shows up in the about section. The intention I’m trying to show is what unique value does Gumbo provide and how can we be more explicit about the problems we can solve for our partners."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- I think the circular ecosystem is still good to keep because we can say this is how we’re driving impact for you and it is activated through the circular ecosystem we’re trying to build"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Gumbo is a storytelling platform and content engine that expands the narrative of Black life.** We’re creating a circular ecosystem for Black expression led by curators, creatives, consumers, and champions of the Black community."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- If we have a dedicated services page I think we can move the services from the About page and put our values there. This ([https://www.uber.com/us/en/careers/values/](https://www.uber.com/us/en/careers/values/)) is what I’m envisioning from a copy POV"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- I think the services page should focus solely on traditional services and see the Seed Project as a separate entity that is powered or fueld by Gumbo and should have it’s own dedicated space"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- I do agree that we should have a dedicated stories section, I think this can live like a blog with linking out to Reckoning and provide a space for our own thought leadership and musings etc"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- I’m going back and forth on the dedicated products page. I get the intention, but I feel like docket is similar to the seed project. I see us mentioning docket under our “works” section"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-30",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Sitemap"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Hey. I think this looks good. And I think you're right on the organization of the content. Just a couple of edits:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Storytelling"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- let's move the logo carousel to either the home page or the services page."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- I think Docket might be its own tab eventually, as well as it's own site. But if you feel this is the right place for it, I'm fine with that."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Services"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Let's cut digital good, physical/merch, and software for now. So it should be:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Service offerings"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Pricing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Process"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Clients (if you decide to add the carousel here)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Impact (maybe add this section. we can do a counter with 4 data points demonstrating impact)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Form"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- CTA"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- About - solid as is."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Works"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Looks good. We should maybe have a primary highlight version, like you're sharing here."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Maybe the full logo gallery from our Capabilities Deck?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Contact - solid as is."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "(edited)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}